@local/dsh-grok-xai README · 验证安装：- **Plugins** 页面能看到 `@local/dsh-grok-xai`，且已启用；
- **设置 → 模型** 页面底部能看到 **Grok（xAI 订阅）** 卡片；
- 如果看不到，刷新页面；Host 代码更新后可能需要重启 DSH。

@local/dsh-grok-xai README · 卸载：1. 建议先在卡片里点 **退出登录**（删除本地 OAuth 记录）。
2. 在 **Plugins** 中移除该 bundle。
3. 卸载不会自动删除 `llm-pi-ai` 中的 `xai` 提供商配置；如不再使用，可在 **设置 → 模型** 删除该提供商，或从 profile 的 `cordis.patch.yml` 中移除 `providers.xai`。

@local/dsh-grok-xai README · 致谢：- [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) 的插件、授权和 pi-ai 适配器
- [pi-supergrok-usage](https://github.com/MatheusBBarni/pi-supergrok-usage) 与 [openusage](https://github.com/openusage-community/openusage) 对 Grok 账单端点的公开整理
- [xAI Models REST API](https://docs.x.ai/developers/rest-api-reference/inference/models) 与 [xAI Reasoning 文档](https://docs.x.ai/developers/model-capabilities/text/reasoning)

@local/dsh-grok-xai README · Option 1: Install directly from DSH (recommended)：1. Read the repository's `package.json` and confirm it declares `dsh.bundle.patch`;
2. install it from Git into the current profile through `plugin_manager`'s `install_bundle`;
3. add the bundle to `dsh.profile.bundles` and enable it;
4. show `@local/dsh-grok-xai` on the **Plugins** page.

The installation may require one approval (`danger-full-access` or an approval prompt). Then:

@local/dsh-grok-xai README · Option 1: Install directly from DSH (recommended)：1. Open **Settings → Models**;
2. scroll to the **Grok (xAI Subscription)** card at the bottom;
3. sign in with SuperGrok / X Premium.

> This installs a Git snapshot. To update, ask DSH to reinstall the same URL or use the **Plugins** page update action. It does not follow a local `git pull`.
>
> If your DSH version's installer does not accept Git URLs, it will report that it cannot resolve the spec; use Option 2 (clone and install locally) instead.

@local/dsh-grok-xai README · Verify the installation：- The **Plugins** page shows `@local/dsh-grok-xai` and it is enabled;
- **Settings → Models** shows the **Grok (xAI Subscription)** card;
- If not, refresh the page; Host code changes may require a DSH restart.

@local/dsh-grok-xai README · Uninstall：1. Sign out from the card (optional, deletes the local OAuth record).
2. Remove the bundle in **Plugins**.

Removing the bundle does not remove the `xai` provider from `llm-pi-ai`; delete it in **Settings → Models** or remove `providers.xai` from the profile patch if you no longer want it.

